%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 79c1856cac5ce614280ef9d32b707814, type: 3}
  m_Name: Daniel_recipe
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeaRecipe
  introText: Uh... hey. I was hoping you could recommend something. I don't really
    know much about tea...
  questionSets:
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: First time here?
      npcResponse: Yeah. I spend a lot of time playing games. At some point I realized
        I wasn't really playing just because it was fun anymore, it became a bit
        of escapism from everything else going on.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55e65514ccca34140ad74edaae66ee99, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Long day?
      npcResponse: Not really. I was about to start another game, but then I caught
        myself putting everything else off again. I've gotten pretty good at procrastination,
        so I figured I'd come here instead.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 31083b91fb82f314889acd5a566ee3a0, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Looking for anything special today?
      npcResponse: Not anything specific. I just wanted to get away from my screen
        for a while. Games are great, but sometimes I use them as escapism instead
        of dealing with what's actually on my mind.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55e65514ccca34140ad74edaae66ee99, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: This place can get pretty busy. Does that bother you?
      npcResponse: "Not really. Normally I like a more isolated environment, but
        currently I\u2019m fine here."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7624dbd73c8564a449236cacbd1b26b0, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Not one to go out in town often, huh?
      npcResponse: "I only go out when I need something. Most of the time I keep
        to myself. I guess I\u2019ve fallen into a habit of social withdrawal.\t"
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 530f546daa14db643af8c1b6e394a939, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: You seem pretty comfortable on your own.
      npcResponse: "I am, mostly. Though sometimes I wonder if I\u2019ve gotten a
        little too good at avoiding others."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4ac325e9cc8a684aa89a8409ebec0f8, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: So what brought you here instead of staying home?
      npcResponse: "I don\u2019t know\u2026 I guess I wanted to be somewhere people
        actually talk to each other. I\u2019ve been wanting conversation lately.
        That is, one that\u2019s outside of a game\u2019s chatroom."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 065d6a09a93f2be4aaddb88398bb813e, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Is my humble tea worth leaving the house for?
      npcResponse: "The tea we shall see, but\u2026 Maybe it was the company. I\u2019ve
        been feeling left out, to be honest. And in games there\u2019s no one to
        make me feel like that."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ff555bbc08278814e9aead26cfc6f59e, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: Finding what you were looking for so far?
      npcResponse: "Kind of, I guess. It\u2019s nice hearing people chat. Sometimes
        I end up feeling left out when I realize how little I do that."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ff555bbc08278814e9aead26cfc6f59e, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: Ever thought about joining some of those conversations?
      npcResponse: A few times. I usually talk myself out of it. A little encouragement
        would probably go a long way.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae962c1c8c6b0e14bb4c0dabbe47355d, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: "What\u2019s the worst that could happen if you\u2019d join
        a conversation?"
      npcResponse: I mean, nothing. Or some stares from the people, probably. Still,
        part of me wants some reassurance before I put myself in that situation.
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a499c46dee9694fb2427ccc5ec9a5f, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: You strike me as someone who thinks things through.
      npcResponse: "Maybe too much. Sometimes I wonder whether people actually want
        me around. It\u2019s silly, but I guess I\u2019m looking for a bit of validation."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2be31dc8bd769d9428c706cf79ccb25c, type: 2}
  - exchanges:
    - playerQuestion: Not many people would admit that.
      npcResponse: "Yeah\u2026 talking about it makes me feel a little too vulnerable,
        to be honest."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1a31f6714614eec4ca8f961471f676e4, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: What do you think would make things easier?
      npcResponse: "I don\u2019t need much. Just a bit of support every now and then."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c32166d6b01f77143b7170c8b84b28e7, type: 2}
    - playerQuestion: How are you liking the teahouse so far?
      npcResponse: "It\u2019s nice. Quiet, but not lonely, like my apartment. There\u2019s
        something really comforting about being here."
      keyword: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 625f5205aabc3a742905577e444f9820, type: 2}
  requiredIngredients: []
